 besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Le fameux \"shakeout run\" à faire soit la veille soit l'avant-veille. Il n'y a pas de bonne solution, que des préférences personnelles. De toute façon, ce n'est plus ça qui fera la différence : tu es prêt(e).","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_15","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":191,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":595,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1791763200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":3.4536951965844143,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":900,"pace":{"value":326}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":191}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace"